# Platform surfaces

**Product north star:** `docs/NORTHSTAR.md` — find people, get outside together (residents, expats, visitors; hikes, camps, runs, and more). Architecture and copy must serve that, not trail-inventory or host-console framing for consumers.

Canonical detail: **`docs/DOCS_INDEX.md`** · **`docs/SYSTEM_COHERENCE.md`** · **`docs/DOMAIN_CANONICALS.md`** · **`docs/NORTHSTAR.md`**, **`MEMBER_MODEL.md`**, **`NAVIGATION.md`**, **`CREATE_FLOW.md`**, **`API_ROUTING.md`**, **`ARCHITECTURE.md`**, **`LANDING.md`**. Docs: update Tier-1 in place (`DOCS_GOVERNANCE.md`). Gate: **`npm run verify:system`**. Paths: `src/config/routingCatalog.ts`.

## Surfaces (where users go)

| Surface | Route | Who | Purpose |
|---------|-------|-----|---------|
| **Marketing** | `/` | **Guests only** | Emotional promise + trust + proof → Explore / Join free |
| **Browse (product home)** | `/explore` | Everyone | Find people and outdoor plans — map-first discovery |
| **Personal hub** | `/profile`, `/profile/settings` | Signed in | Your crew, up next, settings |
| **Entity detail** | `/activity`, `/trail`, `/camp`, `/shop`, `/operator`, … | Public / signed in | Understand the plan → connect → join |
| **Host console** | `/host/*` | Approved hosts | Enable others to go together (secondary audience) |
| **Admin** | `/admin/*` | Platform admins | Moderation, approvals |

**Do not conflate Marketing (`/`) with Browse (`/explore`).** Members never use `/` as home.

## Redirects

- Signed-in user hits `/` → `/explore` (`Home.tsx`)  
- Legacy `/map`, `/discovery`, … → `/explore` (`App.tsx`)  
- Post-auth default → `/explore` (`authRedirect.ts`)  
- Use `explorePath()` / `EXPLORE_MAP_PATH` — not ad-hoc `/explore?…` strings outside `exploreRouting.ts` and `platform.ts`

## Core entity

- **Activity** — scheduled outing; join via **I'm going** (RSVP) or **request to join** (approval) — see `docs/CREATE_FLOW.md`
- **Explore map payload** — activities, venue places, shops, participant demand (see `apps/api/src/lib/explore-map.ts`)

## Layer boundaries

- **Hosting UI** → `/host/*` only — not on `/explore` browse chrome or `/` marketing  
- **Explore copy** → `src/explore/exploreCopy.ts` + `docs/experiment/explore-ux-spec.md`  
- **Create / FAB** → `docs/CREATE_FLOW.md` + `src/explore/ui/*Create*`  
- **Landing copy** → `src/content/homeLanding.ts` + `docs/LANDING.md` + `docs/NORTHSTAR.md`  
- **Canonical voice strings** → `src/content/productNorthStar.ts`  
- Avoid legacy route names in new UI: bare `/activities` as browse, OrganizerActivitiesPath, Trips page
